  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof extensions would cumulatively result in an excessive scale and massing, resulting in an obtrusive, top heavy, incongruous and dominating addition to the host property, considered harmful and out of keeping with the streetscene. As such,&amp;nbsp; the proposal is contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
